	text: [
		"Once you know which items contain which aspects, it's time to boil them down into liquid. ",
		"",
		"Start by placing the §6Infuser§r onto §6Smoldering Peat§r, and add up to 3 buckets of §6Swamp Water§r. ",
		"",
		"Once the water is boiling (indicated by the bubbles and steam), it's time to place up to 6 §6ground§r items.",
		"",
		"It's important to keep §6stearing occasionally§r by right-clicking the Infuser!",
		"",
		"There are 2 different outcomes that can happen:",
		"",
		"1) If the aspects on the items would be enough to form an Elixir, the color of the liquid will slowly turn into a §1dark indigo§r, and eventually drastically change into a different color, making a sound effect.",
		"",
		"2) If the aspects on the items would NOT create an Elixir, the liquid will immediately turn into a §5purple-pink§r color.",
		"",
		"Once either of these things happens, sneak right-clicking the Infuser with a bucket."
	],
